## Memory Layers

| Layer | File | Purpose | When to Load |
|-------|------|---------|--------------|
| **L1 Hot** | `memory/fact.yml` | Active preferences, tools, rules | Every session (auto) |
| **L1 Cold** | `memory/fact_archive.yml` | Inactive/evaluated items | Reviewing old data |
| **L1 Cold** | `memory/fact_decisions.yml` | Historical decisions | Checking precedent |
| **L1 Episodes** | `memory/episodic.jsonl` | Lessons, milestones, failures | Need past lessons |
| **L0.5 Scratch** | `memory/scratchpad.md` | Current task working notes | During active tasks |

## Quick Links

| Need | Where |
|------|-------|
| User preferences | `memory/fact.yml` → `user` section |
| Active tools | `memory/fact.yml` → `tools` section |
| System rules | `memory/fact.yml` → `rules` section |
| Past failures | `grep '"type":"failure"' memory/episodic.jsonl` |
| Recent milestones | `tail -5 memory/episodic.jsonl` |

