## Loading Strategy

```
1. Session start → This file + fact.yml (auto via `CLAUDE.md` or equivalent root file)
2. Need detail → Load relevant layer on demand
3. Task complete → Update episodic.jsonl if significant (manually or via automation)
4. Session end → Clear scratchpad if task finished
```

